    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.66316,
        0.07678,
        0.82807,
        0.07998
      ],
      "text": "1. THIS SHEET IS PART OF A FICTIONAL SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION PACKAGE PREPARED BY IFI LABS / SYNTHETIC CAD. IT IS"
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.67332,
        0.08292,
        0.82649,
        0.08644
      ],
      "text": "NOT FOR CONSTRUCTION AND HAS NOT BEEN PREPARED, SIGNED OR SEALED BY A LICENSED PROFESSIONAL ENGINEER."
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.66288,
        0.09224,
        0.83477,
        0.09573
      ],
      "text": "2.DIMENSIONS ARE TO CENTERLINE OF POSTS UNLESS NOTED OTHERWISE. DO NOT SCALE DRAWINGS; WRITTEN DIMENSIONS GOVERN."
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.66315,
        0.10226,
        0.83296,
        0.10577
      ],
      "text": "3. GATE OPENING SIZES ARE NOT SHOWN ON THIS SHEET. REFER TO THE GATE DETAILS, SECTION 32 31 13 AND ANY ADDENDA FOR"
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.67162,
        0.10769,
        0.6997,
        0.11137
      ],
      "text": "GATE REQUIREMENTS."
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.66279,
        0.117,
        0.80073,
        0.12069
      ],
      "text": "4. SPACE LINE POSTS EQUALLY BETWEEN CORNER, TERMINAL AND GATE POSTS AT 10'-0\" O.C. MAXIMUM."
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.66291,
        0.12633,
        0.83126,
        0.12984
      ],
      "text": "5. FABRIC, FRAMEWORK, FITTINGS, FOOTINGS AND INSTALLATION SHALL CONFORM TO SECTION 32 31 13 – CHAIN LINK FENCES AND"
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.67178,
        0.13246,
        0.72143,
        0.13598
      ],
      "text": "GATES, AND TO SHEETS F501 AND F502."
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.66318,
        0.14177,
        0.83511,
        0.14529
      ],
      "text": "6. COURT PAVEMENT, SURFACING, PLAYING LINES, NETS AND NET POSTS ARE BY OTHERS AND ARE SHOWN FOR REFERENCE ONLY."
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.67192,
        0.14792,
        0.7794,
        0.15112
      ],
      "text": "COORDINATE POST LOCATIONS WITH PAVEMENT CONTRACTOR BEFORE PLACEMENT."
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.663,
        0.15724,
        0.82627,
        0.16044
      ],
      "text": "7. VERIFY ALL DIMENSIONS AND LAYOUT IN THE FIELD BEFORE SETTING POSTS. REPORT DISCREPANCIES TO THE OWNER'S"
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.67201,
        0.16337,
        0.73957,
        0.16657
