      "text": "REQUIREMENTS, TRADE CLASSIFICATIONS AND CERTIFIED-PAYROLL OBLIGATIONS APPLY, AS STATED IN THE CONTRACT LABOR￾COMPLIANCE DOCUMENTS. APPLICABILITY IS NOT ESTABLISHED BY THESE DRAWINGS. SUBMIT A WRITTEN REQUEST FOR"
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.67357,
        0.20655,
        0.73795,
        0.21023
      ],
      "text": "CLARIFICATION BEFORE THE QUESTION DEADLINE."
    },
    {
      "rect_norm": [
        0.66316,
        0.21635,
        0.83362,
        0.21956
      ],
      "text": "10. LOCATE AND PROTECT ALL UNDERGROUND UTILITIES THROUGH THE STATE ONE-CALL SYSTEM BEFORE EXCAVATING FOR POST"
